  message: "ADR-0020 Status corrected in PR #1538 (merge 17a5440feb; docs only, per human decision 'Only fix ADR-0020'). Status is now 'Accepted — partially implemented'; a new Implementation status section records: Part 1 (S capture, R/A/L/U annotation overlay, arrow-key nudge, sanitized SVG injection via tui._on_annotation_result) is live, with deviations (annotated SVG overwrites the original; no JSON sidecar/<metadata>). Part 2 is not wired: TUI calls only preview.extract_svg_paths + format_preview_placeholder ('[screenshot: name]' / '— file not found'). Library-only, no production caller: preview.render_svg_preview/cache/clear_cache/format_unavailable_notice, preview_pipeline.py, svg_detection.py (disagrees: accepts 'docs/x.svg', preview rejects — re-verified), svg_injection.py, screenshot_save.py. README index row and tracker CHANGELOG v0.2.0 entry aligned. Code left in place; item stays open for the decision on wiring vs. removing the preview code."  # e284
